Unreleased
  * Renamed package munge -> mungetext; packaged with pyproject/hatchling and
    uv (src/ layout), replacing setup.py. Python >=3.14.
  * MIT license.
  * Ruff lint/format replaces flake8/isort.
  * joinlines() keyword "seperator" -> separator.
  * Fixed by_simple_para() calling nonexistent str.inestrip().
  * Fixed dehyphenate() dropping a hyphenated final line.
  * Fixed strip_comments() cutting at last (not first) comment char and treating it as a regex.
  * Fixed slurp_re() IndexError when no line matches stopon.
  * Fixed by_page() IndexError on leading page break; text after a page break is no longer dropped.
  * Fixed by_para() never collecting ReST directives; no longer yields empty paragraphs.
  * TitleByRegexFactory() accepts a str, compiled pattern, or iterable of either.

Version  0.0.1 Dec/2021
  * Initial.
